      "**Implement a Niche-Specific Content & SEO Strategy:** Develop high-value, long-form content (blog posts, whitepapers, guides) directly addressing the specialized pain points and unique workflows of 1-2 target industries. Optimize for long-tail keywords that competitors are unlikely to dominate due to their generalist approach. Showcase deeply integrated AI solutions.",
